				"name": "⚙️ Emphasis",
				"codeConnect": true,
				"values": ["weak", "strong"],
				"note": "In Figma, emphasis is expressed via separate Component Sets (Weak vs Strong). Code Connect maps to emphasis prop."
			}
		},
